  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed change of use to 1x1\r\nbedroom flat by reason of inadequate marketing over a 12 month period and current\r\noffice use within the site would result in direct conflict with Policy DM32 of the\r\nHarrow Development Management Local Plan (2013) and Policy E1 of the London Plan\r\n(2021).&nbsp;",
    "The proposed bedroom would result\r\nin poor outlook and access to light resulting in a substandard level of accommodation\r\nseverely impacting the amenity of the prospective occupiers. This is contrary\r\nto the Policies DM1 (c), (f), (g) and DM26 (c), (d Harrow Development\r\nManagement Local Plan (2013), and London Plan Policy D3.D(1), (7).&nbsp;"
  ],
